{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》即將播出，為隆重其事，總監製鍾澍佳（佳導）率領4位主演楊茜堯、陳豪、姚子羚及傅嘉莉出席看片會。</p><p>活動上楊茜堯率先爆出結局劇情，佳導補充今次大結局的一鏡到底畫面，比起《新聞女王 2》龔慈恩的一鏡到底是「雙倍炸裂」。</p><p>事緣楊茜</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T14:41:31.499876+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T12:56:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T14:38:17.869852+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T14:38:17.869852+00:00","content_hash":"49318477229928de5e5a86a4f51dc207fb7e33159ba08700651ba93a82ffb994","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}